  "description": "Database-local integer interning for stable type identity: maps a Compze TypeId to a small, per-database int and back for compact storage references, durably linking every spelling a type has been persisted as (reclassification and renames) behind a small, storage-agnostic provider interface. Depends only on Compze.TypeIdentifiers.",
